Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:37.57,Hdr,,0,0,0,,December 26, 1999 - Arima Kinen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:01.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Going Suzuka leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:04.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi joins him on the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,And on the far outside, Grass Wonder, Special Week right behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,These two are trying to come through together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:13.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Up the hill - Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi now leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grass Wonder outside - and Special Week too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:18.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,T.M. Opera O bursts through the gap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:20.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's a fierce battle up front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two in front - Special Week and Grass Wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,They hit the line together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:29.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Which one? They're dead level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The lifelong rivals - it's a photo finish
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:35.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Back-to-back or revenge - which will it be?!